{"4072600": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Let Me Catch You", "steam_appid": 4072600, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Let Me Catch You</strong> is a <strong>first-person co-op horror and PvP ghost hunting game</strong> where investigation, fear, and player interaction define survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or in <strong>online co-op for up to 4 players</strong> as paranormal investigators exploring <strong>haunted private houses</strong>. Your goal is to search for paranormal activity, collect <strong>ghost evidence</strong>, complete optional side objectives, and determine the <strong>ghost type</strong> based on the clues it leaves behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each ghost has <strong>unique behavior, abilities, and three specific types of evidence</strong>. Correct identification is required to perform the <strong>exorcism ritual</strong> and banish the entity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Asymmetrical PvP Horror</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the <strong>asymmetrical PvP mode</strong>, one player controls the ghost while the others play as hunters.<br>The ghost actively manipulates the environment, drains the hunters’ sanity, and triggers the <strong>Hunt Phase</strong> — a deadly moment where the ghost can chase and kill players.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Permanent Death &amp; Sanity System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fear has consequences.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunters must manage their <strong>sanity</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Low sanity increases danger during hunts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the ghost catches a player, <strong>they die permanently</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision matters.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-person horror experience</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1–4 player online co-op</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Asymmetrical PvP mode</strong> (play as the ghost)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ghost investigation and <strong>evidence-based gameplay</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique ghost abilities and behaviors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sanity system affecting gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Permanent death</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Side objectives for additional risk and reward</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic haunted house locations</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Let Me Catch You</strong> is a <strong>first-person co-op horror and PvP ghost hunting game</strong> where investigation, fear, and player interaction define survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or in <strong>online co-op for up to 4 players</strong> as paranormal investigators exploring <strong>haunted private houses</strong>. Your goal is to search for paranormal activity, collect <strong>ghost evidence</strong>, complete optional side objectives, and determine the <strong>ghost type</strong> based on the clues it leaves behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each ghost has <strong>unique behavior, abilities, and three specific types of evidence</strong>. Correct identification is required to perform the <strong>exorcism ritual</strong> and banish the entity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Asymmetrical PvP Horror</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the <strong>asymmetrical PvP mode</strong>, one player controls the ghost while the others play as hunters.<br>The ghost actively manipulates the environment, drains the hunters’ sanity, and triggers the <strong>Hunt Phase</strong> — a deadly moment where the ghost can chase and kill players.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Permanent Death &amp; Sanity System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fear has consequences.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunters must manage their <strong>sanity</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Low sanity increases danger during hunts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the ghost catches a player, <strong>they die permanently</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision matters.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-person horror experience</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1–4 player online co-op</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Asymmetrical PvP mode</strong> (play as the ghost)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ghost investigation and <strong>evidence-based gameplay</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique ghost abilities and behaviors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sanity system affecting gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Permanent death</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Side objectives for additional risk and reward</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic haunted house locations</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Let Me Catch You is a first-person multiplayer ghost hunting horror game with co-op and asymmetrical PvP. Play solo or with up to 4 players, gather evidence, identify the ghost, and banish it — or play as the ghost and hunt the investigators.", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Polish, Russian, Ukrainian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072600/05b0f87f2c974edc4b1f5e30f28c5f317a4c0577/header.jpg?t=1770641993", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072600/a4b89d5f553514e52e820df3d59fda34c3c35e72/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770641993", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072600/a4b89d5f553514e52e820df3d59fda34c3c35e72/capsule_184x69.jp